# Closed-Loop UI Verification Protocol

Before declaring any UI task complete, the UI Agent must execute the following automated verification gates:

## Gate 1: Design System & Token Gate
- Ensure all color references match keys in `COLORS`.
- Ensure all typography uses `FONT_FAMILY`.
- Ensure all spacings use `Spacing` / `FontSize` / `Radius` / `Shape`.
- Ensure all user-facing strings are exported from `STRINGS`.

## Gate 2: Static Type & Compiler Gate
- Execute `npx tsc --noEmit`.
- Verify 0 TypeScript compiler diagnostics across all created or modified files.
- Resolve any missing prop types, incorrect imports, or JSX structure mismatches.

## Gate 3: Testability & Accessibility Gate
- Verify container and interactive components have valid `testID`s.
- Verify icons are imported from `lucide-react-native` and styled with tokens.
